SUMMARY:European economic security in an age of de-risking
DESCRIPTION:In-person conference. Drawing on US\, Japanese\, and Chinese insights\, this talk assesses Europe's current de-risking strategies to propose a more constructive\, network-aware approach to economic security and supply chain resilience.\nhttps://www.sciencespo.fr/fr/evenements/european-economic-security-in-an-age-of-de-risking/
LOCATION:Sciences Po\, 27 rue Saint-Guillaume\, Paris 7e
URL:https://www.sciencespo.fr/fr/evenements/european-economic-security-in-an-age-of-de-risking/
END:VEVENT
